{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《非份之罪》憑藉另類寫實的題材與緊湊的劇情，成功吸引大批觀眾收看。據最新收視資料顯示，上周播出的大結局最高收視一舉衝破 20.9 點，合共吸引高達 135 萬觀眾追睇，為劇集畫下完美句號。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為慶祝劇集創下如此亮眼的佳績，監製王心慰特意舉辦慶功晚宴，並率領劇中各大單元的演員齊聚一堂。當晚出席陣容鼎盛，現場星光熠熠，氣氛相當熱鬧！<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">各大單元演員，包括陳煒、劉佩玥、阮浩棕、戴祖儀、單立文、何沛珈、吳偉豪、林秀怡、鄧智堅、徐榮、張彥博、胡敏芝、方紹聰、葉靖儀、韋家雄、貝安琪、張翼東、陳嘉俊、陳力行、黃意天、翟威廉、蔡誌恩、唐嘉麟、施焯日、何啟南、鬼塚、彭翔翎、嘉駿、江榮暉及區靄玲齊聚慶功晚宴！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e44adfaf-ce3e-4f2c-9d67-c8508c0fe17e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ED530WbNnh1785986600.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e44adfaf-ce3e-4f2c-9d67-c8508c0fe17e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e44adfaf-ce3e-4f2c-9d67-c8508c0fe17e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ED530WbNnh1785986600.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e44adfaf-ce3e-4f2c-9d67-c8508c0fe17e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T09:21:50.611779+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}